[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755532028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#issuecomment-2755532028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104625","id":2755532028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kPhT8","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T19:24:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T19:24:55Z","body":"I've been trying to convert the example code for use as a unit test (in `tests/core/math/test_triangle_mesh.h`), but I haven't gotten it to pass:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#pragma once\r\n\r\n#include \"core/math/triangle_mesh.h\"\r\n#include \"scene/resources/3d/primitive_meshes.h\"\r\n#include \"tests/test_macros.h\"\r\n\r\nnamespace TestTriangleMesh {\r\n\r\nTEST_CASE(\"[SceneTree][TriangleMesh] BVH creation and intersection\") {\r\n\tRef<BoxMesh> box_mesh;\r\n\tbox_mesh.instantiate();\r\n\r\n\tconst Vector<Face3> faces = box_mesh->get_faces();\r\n\r\n\tRef<TriangleMesh> triangle_mesh;\r\n\ttriangle_mesh.instantiate();\r\n\tCHECK(triangle_mesh->create_from_faces(Variant(faces)));\r\n\r\n\tconst Vector3 begin = Vector3(0.0, 2.0, 0.0);\r\n\tconst Vector3 end = Vector3(0.0, -2.0, 0.0);\r\n\r\n\tVector3 point;\r\n\tVector3 normal;\r\n\tint32_t* surf_index = nullptr;\r\n\tint *face_index = nullptr;\r\n\tconst bool has_result = triangle_mesh->intersect_segment(begin, end, point, normal, surf_index, face_index);\r\n\tCHECK(has_result);\r\n\tCHECK(point.is_equal_approx(Vector3(0.0, 0.5, 0.0)));\r\n\tCHECK(normal.is_equal_approx(Vector3(0.0, 1.0, 0.0)));\r\n\tCHECK(surf_index == nullptr);\r\n\tREQUIRE(face_index != nullptr);\r\n\tCHECK(*face_index == 8);\r\n}\r\n\r\n} // namespace TestTriangleMesh\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt crashes on the last `CHECK` line because `REQUIRE(face_index != nullptr)` fails (although interestingly, it does not stop test execution and still crashes afterwards).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755532028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757207050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#issuecomment-2757207050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104625","id":2757207050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kV6QK","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T08:44:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T08:44:26Z","body":"> It crashes on the last CHECK line because REQUIRE(face_index != nullptr) fails (although interestingly, it does not stop test execution and still crashes afterwards).\r\n\r\nIt should fail I think? `face_index` looks like an optional pointer set by the caller if you want it to return the face index.\r\n\r\nThe function shouldn't be changing the `face_index` pointer itself, only the contents (if it was set to something on entry).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757207050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764334388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#issuecomment-2764334388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104625","id":2764334388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kxGU0","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organization