art":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2771879871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#issuecomment-2771879871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104625","id":2771879871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lN4e_","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T08:54:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T08:58:51Z","body":"> Returning things from a \"performance\" function in a Dictionary is a bit scary\r\n\r\nFor GDScript it does not really matter apart from not being type safe. The problem that you are referring to exists primarily for languages like C# that trash their memory with creating new Dictionary stuff until their garbage collector crashes the performance in their projects.\r\n\r\nThe performance preferred way would be to have a reuseable parameter and result object that can be populated, updated and reused for each query. That also allows to better document each single parameter.\r\n\r\nWe already use that for e.g. navigation queries and a lot of the newer physics queries but because it requires to add so much extra stuff I cant really justify that for the TriangleMesh right now. If there is actual demand it can be added later as it needs its own query function for the parameters anyway.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2771879871/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2772444479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#issuecomment-2772444479","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104625","id":2772444479,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lQCU_","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T12:43:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T12:43:00Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2772444479/reactions","total_count":1